      "prompt": "OAB is a triangle with OA = \\vec{a} and OB = \\vec{b}. Point P lies on AB such that AP:PB = 3:4. Find the vector OP in terms of \\vec{a} and \\vec{b}, giving your answer in its simplest form.",
